om RapidAPI, a large dataset of publicly available REST APIs.\" That supports all.\n\nNote must include two answers, page numbers and continuous exact quotations, within 1500 chars. Let's write note tool_use now using ev-731fa63b8d34dde45e62.\n\nThen recall remaining pending batch to advance. But one action only per turn. Write note then stop. Must include complete exact content in prose before code. Let's craft Chinese note content ~ maybe 500 chars, includes exact quote.\n\nContent:\n\"tool_use（p.23）。Toolformer 测试五种工具：calculator、question_answering、search_engine、translation、calendar；ToolBench 含 16,464 个 RapidAPI API。原文：'A range of tools is tested: a calculator, a question-answering system, a search engine, a translation system, and a calendar. Further works extend this to a larger range of tools. ToolBench [Qin et al., 2023] contains 16,464 APIs from RapidAPI, a large dataset of publicly available REST APIs.' 页码 23。\"\n\nEnsure content 20..1500 chars. Good."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 8555, "completion_tokens": 707, "total_tokens": 9262, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4224}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 387}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4224, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 4331}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}, "classification": "ok"}
