}}, "_request_id": null}, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8203, "output_tokens": 432, "total_tokens": 8635}}, "model_output": "CAMEL 在第 37 页明确使用 “inception prompting”；继续读取后续已提取页面，定位 Generative Agents 的人类评估者数量。\n\n```python\nr = recall(['ev-76027d4e758f97793930', 'ev-2bcb169328f17ac85c9d', 'ev-a67fb4f311d1f21c4aba', 'ev-baddfbae8db75139dd16'])\nprint(r)\n```", "code_action": "r = recall(['ev-76027d4e758f97793930', 'ev-2bcb169328f17ac85c9d', 'ev-a67fb4f311d1f21c4aba', 'ev-baddfbae8db75139dd16'])\nprint(r)", "observations": "Execution logs:\n{'scheduled': ['ev-76027d4e758f97793930', 'ev-2bcb169328f17ac85c9d', 'ev-a67fb4f311d1f21c4aba', 'ev-baddfbae8db75139dd16'], 'pending': [], 'capacity_chars': 14779, 'message': 'The selector confirms each actual batch; remaining items stay queued.'}\nLast output from code snippet:\nNone", "observations_images": null, "action_output": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8203, "output_tokens": 432, "total_tokens": 8635}, "is_final_answer": false}}
