g_data, hallucination, agent_behavior, self_reflection, safety。p.52 结论：三类能力均受益于 reasoning 和 self-verification，原文：'Robotic interaction and tool-use build on grounded retrieval augmentation, social interaction (such as theory of mind) builds on self reflection, and all categories benefit from reasoning and self-verification.'\", \"sources\": [\"paper.pdf\"], \"evidence_ids\": [\"ev-99f0f0a37d328bfed1a9\", \"ev-01ce8948bcc88d235ea3\"], \"valid\": true, \"request\": 18}}}}]"}], "tool_calls": null, "raw": null, "token_usage": null}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Model-authored note overview, sources=['paper.pdf']:\noverview (pages 4-5). Three categories of agentic LLM abilities: reasoning, acting, interacting; p.4 says: 'The categories reasoning–acting–interacting build upon each other' (category 1 reasoning, 2 assistants/acting, 3 multi-agent social simulation/interacting). Literature selection, p.5: 'The papers were initially selected with a Google Scholar search on Agentic LLM. From there, we used a snowballing approach to discover work that was cited but not yet included in our initial set.' Hence search_methods = google_scholar, snowballing. Only LLM-based approaches kept; multi-agent work without LLMs excluded."}], "tool_calls": null, "raw": null, "token_usage": null}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Model-authored note tool_use, sources=['paper.pdf']:\ntool_use（p.23）。Toolformer 测试五种工具：calculator、question_answering、search_engine、translation、calendar；ToolBench 含 16,464 个 RapidAPI API。原文：'A range of tools is tested: a calculator, a question-answering system, a search engine, a translation system, and a calendar. Further works extend this to a larger range of tools. ToolBench [Qin et al., 2023] contains 16,464 APIs from RapidAPI, a large dataset of publicly available REST APIs.' 页码 23。"}], "tool_calls": null, "raw": null, "token_usage": null}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Model-authored note outlook, sources=['paper.pdf']:\noutlook（p.51-52）。Table 4 列出五个研究议题及挑战：Training Data、Hallucination、Agent Behavior、Self reflection、Safety。p.51 原文：'Topic Challenge Training Data Finetune with inference time reasoning data Convergent/stable reinforcement learning VLA, Multimodal signals, such as speech Hallucination Use Self Verification Use Mechanistic Interpretability Use Open Ended/Open World Models for exploration Agent Behavior Scalable simulation infrastructure, role playing Distill reasoning to small models Models of agent and human behavior, emergent behavior, future of society Self reflection In-model self reflection and metareasoning Metacognition, personality Automated Scientific Discovery Safety Assistants: Responsibility, liability Privacy, fairness of data Wider application areas for assistants'。故 agenda_topics = training_data, hallucination, agent_behavior, self_reflection, safety。p.52 结论：三类能力均受益于 reasoning 和 self-verification，原文：'Robotic interaction and tool-use build on grounded retrieval augmentation, social interaction (such as theory of mind) builds on self reflection, and all categories benefit from reasoning and self-verification.'"}], "tool_calls": null, "raw": null, "token_usage": null}], "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_23", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "python_interpreter", "arguments": "st = task_status()\nfor e in st['evidence']:\n    print(e.get('id'), e.get('source'), e.get('page'), str(e.get('locator'))[:60])"}}], "error": null, "model_output_message": {"role": "assistant", "content": "列出已交付证据的 id 与页码，定位 reasoning 和 multi_agent 的页面证据。\n\n```python\nst = task_status()\nfor e in st['evidence']:\n    print(e.get('id'), e.get('source'), e.get('page'), str(e.get('locator'))[:60])\n```", "tool_calls": null, "raw": {"_type": "ChatCompletion", "id": "1f24540a-1151-4922-ba4d-db8dbc35e3fb", "choices": [{"_type": "Choice", "finish_reason": "stop", "index": 0, "logprobs": null, "message": {"_type": "ChatCompletionMessage", "content": "列出已交付证据的 id 